    "content": "All 19 checklist items have been tested and recorded — 11 PASS, 8 FAIL.\n\n**Summary of failures**, which cluster around one root cause plus three isolated gaps:\n\n- **Frozen graph state** (FT-5, FT-7, CT-16, IX-20): the React Flow graph is initialized once and never re-synced with the model, so nodes show stale levels/weights/enabled states and Critical/Gap highlighting, applying a template leaves the old graph in place, and node edit handlers operate on the original snapshot — so a competency can't be re-enabled and each edit silently reverts previous ones.\n- **FT-4**: no UI exists at all to edit relationship (edge) weights.\n- **FT-8 / FT-11**: \"Save Current\" and \"Save\" only fire toasts — no name/description form, no My Templates collection, and no persistence (localStorage/sessionStorage empty), so edits are lost on leaving the model.\n- **IX-19**: the initially selected Recruitment scenario shows 0 adjustments and Run Simulation is a no-op until a tab is switched."
  }
